repository-artifact: >-
abstract: >-
  A bathtub-sector ocean configuration for MOM6. This configuration is designed
  primarily as a test case for implementing new vertical coordinate systems into
  MOM6, and to compare with existing vertical coordinate. Thus, the design criteria
  is to produce the simplest configuration that incorporates buoyancy and wind
  forcing, gyre circulation, overturning circulation and topographically-constrained
  overflows.
